      "control": "press HOME, then wait 0.5 s, then turn SELECT until SONG is selected, then turn ALGORITHM clockwise by 1 detent, then wait 0.3 s, then turn SELECT clockwise by 1 detent, then wait 0.3 s, then turn ALGORITHM clockwise by 1 detent, then wait 0.9 s, then press SEQ, then wait 0.9 s, then turn SELECT clockwise by 0 detents, then wait 0.6 s, then hold EDIT and turn PRESETS clockwise by 6 detents, then wait 1.2 s",
